  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Great Lakes - Disaster Preparedness: Pioneering Innovations in Conflict-Sensitive Disaster Risk Management - 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To roll out anticipatory action in Rwanda and DRC through interagency collaboration on developing common anticipatory action
frameworks, joint triggers, aligning financing mechanisms and jointly advocating for a system-wide shift from reaction to
conflict-sensitive, protection-centred anticipation. As a direct effect of established AA systems in DRC and Rwanda, the aim is to
reduce the cost of humanitarian post-disaster responses by implementing trigger-based AA and mitigating the losses and damages
caused by disasters.</narrative>
  </description>
